  "description": "Thanks to her flirting skills, Leo has gotten a senior to ask her to prom every year. But once she's in her junior year, her vindictive ex, Lizzy, keeps getting in her way. Leo desperately needs a date who won't be affected by Lizzy's social manipulation, so her friend points her in the direction of Rabbit, a mysterious loner who belongs to the art club. What Leo doesn't expect, however, is to fall head over heels for Rabbit at first sight! Now she's even more determined to charm her new crush, but the stoic girl is no easy opponent...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note:\n\\- Originally self-published on the author's Aladin account. Was published by Ridibooks on 2026-05-09.\n\\- Includes three extra chapters.*",
